### Windows
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db

# Folder config file
[Dd]esktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk

# Node
node_modules/
lib/

# Review/diff scratch artifacts
review-*.txt

# Local workflow run artifacts; keep docs/dsh-workflow/INDEX.md versioned
/docs/dsh-workflow/runs/
/docs/dsh-workflow/issues/

# DSH 统一管理目录 <workspace>/.dsh/（run 材料目录 .dsh/.dsh-workflow/runs/<runId>/ 在其下，Issue #173）：忽略且未跟踪
/.dsh/

# Web-client factory bundle output (built on demand, never committed)
/web-client/dist/

.scratch
.playwright-cli
